  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administration Agreement in contribution to the Multi-Donors Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Project is directly supporting the PFMRP II and covers 4 priority areas over a 3-year period: (1) public expenditure and revenue management in federal and subnational governments; (2) strengthening the Office of Auditor General (OAG); (3) improving public procurement; (4) PFM reform management and coordination.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
